  "description": "<p><strong>Brand introduction:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Handmade and highly customizable, our name necklaces, bracelets, rings, and earrings are unique expressions of your individuality. Crafted with precision, wear a piece that's as special as your name. Explore \"My Monikers\" for personalized jewelry that shines with your identity.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Product Description:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>High quality 18K gold plating.</li>\r\n<li>Innovative anti-tarnishing protective coating.</li>\r\n<li>Water, sweat and heat-resistant.</li>\r\n<li>Nickel Free.</li>\r\n<li>Sustainable Jewellery: 60% Recycled Stainless Steel, 80% Recycled, 90% Recycled Sterling Silver.</li>\r\n<li>Eco-Friendly Packaging: 100% plastic-free and all paper-made.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Every 3rd chain, ring, earring is FREE.</li>\r\n<li>Every 3rd charm is FREE.</li>\r\n<li>Enjoy higher discount as you select more charms.</li>\r\n<li>Handmade &amp; highly customizable.</li>\r\n<li>Always the Perfect Gift.</li>\r\n<li>Fast making and shipping time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Payment terms</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Monthly payment via Paypal.</li>\r\n<li>20% commision on each affiliate sale.</li>\r\n<li>Commission can increase depending on the volume of sale up to 40%.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Other information:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Worldwide shipping, usually between 4-10 Working Days depending on where the order is shipped to.</li>\r\n<li>Depending on the level of customization, the making time goes from 5 to 10 working days.</li>\r\n</ul>",
